{"last_link_id": 3, "nodes": [{"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "audio_output", "links": [1], "label": "audio_output", "type": "AUDIO", "localized_name": "audio_output"}, {"name": "filepath", "label": "filepath", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "filepath"}], "size": [412.9109191894531, 509.2322082519531], "pos": [-206.22340393066406, 617.9478759765625], "widgets_values": ["[Verse]\n参数吹到宇宙巅\n代码锁在保险柜\n白皮书堆成摩天殿\n仓库地址从没见\n社区蹲成望夫石\n你在后台算变现\n竞品都把模型献\n你还在发道歉帖\n[Prechorus]\n风口浪尖跑得颠\n你在磨洋工装睡\n等你磨完这波 黄花菜早成灰\n[Chorus]\n承诺是张擦腚纸\n开源是句空壳子\n别人亮刀你装死\n商业算盘敲到死\n这场骗局演得够无耻\n[Verse]\n吹过的牛能绕地球三圈\n画过的饼能喂饱整个产业链\n开发者气得把键盘锤扁\n你还在扯技术不够 “尖端”\n信任碎得像玻璃渣片\n粉丝转黑骂声一片\n所谓的 “行业突破” 全是骗\n不过是割韭菜的表演\n[Bridge]\n别拿 “优化” 当遮羞帘\n别拿 “安全” 当挡箭牌\n口号喊得比谁都正点\n吃相难看没人买账 活该\n[Chorus]\n承诺是张擦腚纸\n开源是句空壳子\n别人亮刀你装死\n商业算盘敲到死\n[Outro]\n还在等开源那天\n行业早把你掀翻", "R&B, drum machine, powerful, epic, Keyboard, electronic，clean female voice", "3B", 123569, 50, 240000, 1.5, 1, 1.5], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "lyrics"}, "name": "lyrics", "label": "lyrics", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "lyrics"}, {"widget": {"name": "tags"}, "name": "tags", "label": "tags", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "tags"}, {"widget": {"name": "version"}, "name": "version", "label": "version", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "version"}, {"widget": {"name": "seed"}, "name": "seed", "label": "seed", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "seed"}, {"widget": {"name": "max_audio_length_ms"}, "name": "max_audio_length_ms", "label": "max_audio_length_ms", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "max_audio_length_ms"}, {"widget": {"name": "topk"}, "name": "topk", "label": "topk", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "topk"}, {"widget": {"name": "temperature"}, "name": "temperature", "label": "temperature", "type": "FLOAT", "localized_name": "temperature"}, {"widget": {"name": "cfg_scale"}, "name": "cfg_scale", "label": "cfg_scale", "type": "FLOAT", "localized_name": "cfg_scale"}], "flags": {}, "id": 1, "type": "HeartMuLa_Generate", "properties": {"cnr_id": "heartmula_comfyui", "ver": "1.0.0", "ue_properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "input_ue_unconnectable": {}, "version": "7.5.2"}, "widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "HeartMuLa_Generate"}, "order": 0}, {"outputs": [], "color": "#432", "widgets_values": ["1. max_audio_length_ms\n含义：最大音频长度，单位是毫秒（ms）\n作用：设置输入音频的最长允许时长。这里设为 240000，也就是240 秒（4 分钟）。\n超过这个时长的音频会被自动截断，确保模型处理的音频长度在设计范围内，避免内存溢出或性能问题。\n2. topk\n含义：Top-K 采样\n作用：生成时只从概率最高的前 K 个候选词中随机选择。这里设为 50。\n值越大，生成结果越丰富但可能发散；值越小，结果越聚焦但可能单调。\n它常用于文本生成、语音合成或音乐生成类模型，平衡多样性与连贯性。\n3. temperature\n含义：温度系数\n作用：控制生成结果的随机性。这里设为 1.0，是中性值。\n温度越高（>1），生成越随机、创意性越强；温度越低（<1），生成越保守、越倾向于高概率内容。\n1.0 表示完全按照模型预测的概率分布进行采样，不做额外调整。\n4. cfg_scale (Classifier-Free Guidance Scale)\n含义：无分类器引导系数\n作用：控制提示词（Prompt）对生成结果的影响强度。这里设为 1.5。\n值越高，生成结果越严格遵循提示词；值越低，生成结果更自由、受提示词约束更小。\n常见范围在 1~10 之间，1.5 属于较低的引导强度，适合希望保留一定生成自由度的场景。"], "inputs": [], "flags": {}, "type": "MarkdownNote", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#653", "size": [370.2872619628906, 274.8255920410156], "pos": [-601.0654296875, 594.5264892578125], "id": 6, "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}}, "order": 1}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [], "size": [423.38555908203125, 209.80332946777344], "pos": [243.9260711669922, 620.0889892578125], "widgets_values": ["audio/ComfyUI"], "inputs": [{"name": "audio", "link": 1, "type": "AUDIO", "localized_name": "音频"}, {"widget": {"name": "filename_prefix"}, "name": "filename_prefix", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "文件名前缀"}, {"widget": {"name": "audioUI"}, "name": "audioUI", "type": "AUDIO_UI", "localized_name": "音频UI"}], "flags": {}, "id": 2, "type": "SaveAudio", "properties": {"cnr_id": "comfy-core", "ver": "0.10.0", "ue_properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "input_ue_unconnectable": {}, "version": "7.5.2"}, "widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "SaveAudio"}, "order": 2}], "extra": {"links_added_by_ue": [], "VHS_KeepIntermediate": true, "ue_links": [], "VHS_MetadataImage": true, "0246.VERSION": [0, 0, 4], "workflowRendererVersion": "LG", "VHS_late